codex
A more structural improvement is available: these bias-free ReLU networks are positively homogeneous, so Gaussian inputs can be decomposed into radius times direction. I’m testing sphere-normalized antithetic samples scaled by the exact Gaussian mean radius, which removes radial Monte Carlo variance.
